WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.619
In <b>Configuración</b> (settings) you make MiCaja fit your business

00:00:03.693 --> 00:00:08.125
Your business name, as it appears at the top and on every ticket

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:10.934
You see it right away, before saving

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:13.593
Your phone number also appears on the ticket

00:00:13.661 --> 00:00:20.491
The <b>PIN</b> MiCaja asks for sensitive actions: credit, returns and price changes

00:00:20.558 --> 00:00:26.750
And here you download the <b>backup</b> of your whole system. Do it often
